      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;5-principles&#34;&gt;5 principles&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;principle-1-focus-on-language-content-that-is-relevant-to-you&#34;&gt;Principle 1 Focus on language content that is relevant to you&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;principle-2-use-new-languages-as-a-tool-to-communicate-from-day-1-like-a-baby&#34;&gt;Principle 2 Use new languages as a tool to communicate from day 1, like a baby&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;principle-3-comprehension-is-the-key&#34;&gt;Principle 3 Comprehension is the key&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;principle-4-language-learning-is-about-physiological-training-its-about-muscles&#34;&gt;Principle 4 Language learning is about physiological training, it&amp;rsquo;s about muscles&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;principle-5-be-happy-and-relaxed-and-must-learn-to-tolerate-ambiguity&#34;&gt;Principle 5 be happy and relaxed, and must learn to tolerate ambiguity&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;7-actions&#34;&gt;7 actions&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;action-1-listen-a-lot&#34;&gt;Action 1 Listen A LOT&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;brain soaking&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;action-2-focus-on-body-language&#34;&gt;Action 2 focus on body language&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;action-3-start-mixing&#34;&gt;Action 3 Start mixing&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;speak like a baby: get creative, do not have to be perfect&lt;/p&gt;</description>
